abstract: "A goal, target and method taxonomy of attacks on the additive manufacturing digital thread, merged from Yampolskiy et al. (2018) and Kumar et al. (2025), with each node annotated with the security property affected, the Cyber Resilience Act requirement engaged and, for attack methods, MITRE ATT&CK mitigations."
